{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>You did not bring Me.</b> Your burnt offerings in Babylonia." "<b>nor did you honor Me.</b> With peace-offering sacrifices, and I did not ask of you that you serve Me with a meal-offering." "<b>nor wearied you with frankincense.</b> That you should purchase for Me."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:48.745065784Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}